2. Third-Party Components
==============================================================================

This project incorporates code written by third parties. Each such component
is listed in the register in Section 2.4, and consists of the files identified
in its entry together with any work derived from them. Sections 2.1 to 2.3
apply to every component in the register.

2.1 Upstream License

    The upstream code of each component is licensed by its copyright holders
    under the license stated in its register entry. The full text of that
    license is reproduced in the Appendix named in the entry. The copyright
    and permission notices that license requires are reproduced in that
    Appendix and remain in the headers of the affected files.

2.2 Sublicensing and Modifications

    Modifications, additions and new works made by [TWA] to a component are
    licensed under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0.

    Where a component's upstream license permits sublicensing, as the MIT
    License does, the component as incorporated and modified in this project
    is licensed to you under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, to
    the extent permitted by that upstream license, including its grant of
    the right to sublicense.

    Where a component's upstream license does not permit this, the component
    remains under its upstream license.

2.3 Upstream Rights Preserved

    Nothing in this file limits the rights of any person in the original,
    unmodified code of a component under its upstream license, as granted by
    its copyright holders.

