==============================================================================
3. Excluded Directory
==============================================================================

The directory modules/melinoe-vpn-kernelspace/ contains a separate project,
distributed alongside this one. It is not part of this project, is not
licensed under this file, and is governed solely by the license contained in
that directory.

This project uses it only as a separately built Linux kernel module,
communicating with it through the kernel's system call interface. Neither
project is licensed under the other's terms by reason of being distributed
together.


